# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale el
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as evening [17:00, 20:00) (CLDR
# evening1 collapsed into chronologia's four-band model).
# Surface: βράδυ (vrády), the neuter noun for "evening" (period between
# sunset and full dark); used bare as an adverb and after the article
# ("το βράδυ").
# Source: Wiktionary, "βράδυ" (noun, gender "n"), which glosses "το
# βράδυ" as its own worked example.
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/βράδυ
# Gender confirms the neuter accusative article "το" (Wiktionary, "το",
# neuter nominative/accusative singular of "ο":
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/το).
βράδυ
